{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For all those who want to show extra support for the game's indie developer, this DLC includes a beautifully detailed and lovingly crafted <strong>42-page</strong>\u00a0<strong>Digital Artbook</strong>, a <strong>Thank You note</strong>, as well as <strong>a pack of wallpapers</strong> to spice up your desktop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We wholeheartedly appreciate your support for our passion project and can't thank you enough for joining us on this journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fly high, Pilots!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About Kamikaze Lassplanes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570310/extras/VN_gif_1.gif?t=1741629289\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570310/extras/SHMUP_gif_1.gif?t=1741629289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kamikaze Lassplanes is a brand new mix of Visual Novel and SHMUP with crucial story-branching decisions that lead to different gameplay and story outcomes, both for war, romance, and the protagonists\u2019 fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570310/extras/_kl__ABOUT_GIF_1.gif?t=1741629289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet and fall for <strong>Alba Tross\u00e9</strong> and <strong>Hannah Brandenburg</strong> - charismatic Lassplanes who transform into deadly war planes you pilot. Face the Imperial fleet together in challenging arcade shoot-'em-up encounters and discover the secret behind their mysterious origin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>But will the gift prove to be a curse?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570310/extras/kl_ABOUT_GIF_2_Hannah_2.gif?t=1741629289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into an engaging, dark story about exploring humanity in a world where every rose has its thorn, and every tool can become a weapon. When nothing is as it seems, your beliefs are shattered as you uncover the truth\u2014and perhaps you\u2019ll pay the ultimate price for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decide the fate of your kingdom and your heart.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570310/extras/SHMUP_gif_2.gif?t=1741629289\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570310/extras/VN_gif_2.gif?t=1741629289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570310/extras/_kl__ABOUT_GIF_3.png?t=1741629289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your choices matter:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock various endings that will reveal different faces of Alba and Hannah. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover and collect a gallery of beautiful, hand-drawn ecchi illustrations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge yourself in Arcade mode and beat records. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control the lethal Lassplanes in various missions set in a fully 3D environment.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570310?t=1741629289","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570310?t=1741629289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570310/aa2a8b1a445b3d0ec1ac8d59c410e3c6ea017ebc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741629289","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570310/aa2a8b1a445b3d0ec1ac8d59c410e3c6ea017ebc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741629289","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For all those who want to show extra support for the game's indie developer, this DLC includes a beautifully detailed and lovingly crafted <strong>42-page</strong>\u00a0<strong>Digital Artbook</strong>, a <strong>Thank You note</strong>, as well as <strong>a pack of wallpapers</strong> to spice up your desktop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We wholeheartedly appreciate your support for our passion project and can't thank you enough for joining us on this journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fly high, Pilots!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>About Kamikaze Lassplanes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570310/extras/VN_gif_1.gif?t=1741629289\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570310/extras/SHMUP_gif_1.gif?t=1741629289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kamikaze Lassplanes is a brand new mix of Visual Novel and SHMUP with crucial story-branching decisions that lead to different gameplay and story outcomes, both for war, romance, and the protagonists\u2019 fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570310/extras/_kl__ABOUT_GIF_1.gif?t=1741629289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet and fall for <s